@@ -19,0 +22,12 @@
+
+`agent orient` and `work` expose `ui_source_handoff` from the same graph
+snapshot used for target resolution. Inspect `status`, `candidates`,
+`unresolved_templates` and `next_ui_static_argv`. `AMBIGUOUS` and `UNRESOLVED`
+have no target hint. For `RESOLVED`, check the selected template SHA-256 and
+condition with `ui static`, then use `suggested_work_argv` or choose an explicit
+target yourself. The hint names a component in the current TS/JS graph; it
+does not silently select that target, change graph resolution, prove the
+component renders, or make `work_status: ready` an action authorization. A
+grounded `--ui-selector` narrows source candidates when multiple components
+declare the same text. Re-run orientation after editing source to get fresh
+digests.
